###
农历（the lunar calendar）起源于数千年前的中国，根据太阳和月亮的运行规律制定。长期以来，农历在农业生产和人们日常生活中发挥着重要作用。古人依据农历记录日期、安排农活，以便最有效地利用自然资源和气候条
件，提高农作物的产量和质量。中国的春节、中秋节等传统节日的日期都基于农历。农历是中国传统文化的重要组成部分，当今依然广为使用。

###
The lunar calendar originated in China before thousands of years, made by runing rotine of the sun and moon. For many years, the lunar calendar played an important role on
aggriculture and people's daily life. According to it, ancient people noted the time and planed planting to use natural resources and sky for improving the production and quality of
grain. A number of Chinese traditional festivals are based on it, including the Spring Festival and Mid-Autumn Festival. The lunar calendar is an integral part of Chinese traditional
culture, and it is used such at present.


### 1. 逐处标注错误 + 修改
1. before thousands of years → thousands of years ago（ago 用于过去时间；before 不能这样用）
2. runing rotine → the movements（拼写错误 running/routine；runing rotine 属于错词，“运行规律” 用 movements）
3. made by → formulated according to（历法是根据规律制定，不是被日月运行制造）
4. played an important role on → has played an important role in（时间 For many years，现在完成时；固定搭配 role in）
5. aggriculture → agriculture（拼写错误）
6. planed planting → arranged farm work（planed 拼写 planned；planting 表意窄，农活 farm work 贴合原文）
7. sky → climatic conditions（sky 是天空，原文是气候条件）
8. for improving → to improve（不定式表目的更合适）
9. used such at present → is still widely used today（such 多余，such at present 完全错误）

###  改正后的你的原文
The lunar calendar originated in China thousands of years ago, formulated according to the movements of the sun and moon. For many years, the lunar calendar has played an important
role in agriculture and people's daily life. According to it, ancient people noted the dates and arranged farm work to use natural resources and climatic conditions to improve the 
production and quality of grain. A number of Chinese traditional festivals are based on it, including the Spring Festival and the Mid-Autumn Festival. The lunar calendar is an 
integral part of Chinese traditional culture, and it is still widely used today.

###  美化版
Originating in China thousands of years ago, the lunar calendar was formulated based on the movement of the sun and the moon. It has long played a vital part in agricultural 
production and people’s daily life. Ancient people recorded dates and arranged farming work following the lunar calendar, so that they could make the best use of natural resources
and climate to boost crop yield and quality. Traditional Chinese festivals such as the Spring Festival and the Mid-Autumn Festival are all dated according to it. As an essential 
component of traditional Chinese culture, the lunar calendar remains widely used to this day.

###  标准版
The lunar calendar originated in China thousands of years ago and was formulated according to the movement rules of the sun and the moon. For a long time, it has played an 
important role in agricultural production and people’s daily life. Ancient people recorded dates and arranged farm work based on the lunar calendar to make the most of natural 
resources and climatic conditions and improve the output and quality of crops. Traditional Chinese festivals including the Spring Festival and the Mid-Autumn Festival are set by
the lunar calendar. The lunar calendar is an important part of traditional Chinese culture and is still widely used nowadays.
